                The &ldquo;Real\" Hourly Rate\r\n                  ","&#34;",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The &#34;Real\" Hourly Rate\r\n                  ","&rdquo;",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The &rdquo;Real\" Hourly Rate\r\n                  ",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The \"Real&quot; Hourly Rate\r\n                  ",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The \"Real&ldquo; Hourly Rate\r\n                  ",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The \"Real&#34; Hourly Rate\r\n                  ",[20057,20121],"\r\n                    The \"Real&rdquo; Hourly Rate\r\n                  ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their &apos;Billed Rate' to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n        ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their &lsquo;Billed Rate' to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n        ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their &#39;Billed Rate' to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n        ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their &rsquo;Billed Rate' to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n        ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their 'Billed Rate&apos; to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n        ",[25777,25982]," Most freelancers underprice because they compare their 'Billed Rate&lsquo; to a salary. A ₹2,500 hourly rate is often equivalent to a ₹1,200 salary after accounting for benefits, taxes, and overheads.\r\n